  dialogues:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: The client is a little disappointed. They appreciate the effort put in,
      and note that a few things from the list will be required but have not been
      put on the drawings by the design team. The cost being significantly over budget
      is unacceptable at this stage and they ask you what you intend to do about
      it.
